Z||000000||fogglethorpe||08-14-2001||11:03 PM||||1) I must sacrifice some degree of personal liberty to be safe. (Or, I will be safer without a gun)<P>2)Keeping more of my money makes me greedy, and hurts the economy. In fact, it is my civic duty to have 40% of my income confiscated.<P>3)SUV's are the worst invention of all time, are driven by evil, cigar chomping  capitalists, and will eventually cause an environmental meltdown, which will end the world.<P>4)The so-called news media is the 4th branch of government.<P>5)All speech is protected by the United States Constitution, unless it's "hate speech" (i.e., religious or politically conservative).<P>6)Morality is not black and white, but is defined by individual choice. (Or, feelings are mightier than truth)<P>7)All life is precious, especially that of suckerfish, spotted owls, and various unnamed foliage in the rain forests. Unborn human babies, however, are unviable tissue masses, and therefore unworthy of protection under the law (unless they are harvested for medical research).<P>8)The United States has the worst healthcare system in the entire known universe, and must instead revert to a socialized system which has failed miserably everywhere else it's been tried.<P>9)The Federal Government is the provider, protector, and empowerer of all people.<P>10)Rich people are vermin, and acquired their wealth on the backs of the poor. For this, they should be severely punished by litigation and taxation.<P>Need I go on? I've got more...||||reg||1
