Z||000013||Formula88||08-15-2001||02:06 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by ray b:<BR><B>poor fools nobody who drives a fiero is rich enuff to get in the republican's inner club.why workers would want the masters to get richer,at their expence is beyond me.<BR>btw the real tax on long term $$$ is 20% and falling now but workers still pay for near 15% ss tax plus income tax and that adds up to way more than the rich pay now.<BR>bush and his gang stold the election and now want to steal the surpluss instead of paying the past do debts.<P><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Get real. The definition of rich is anyone who makes more money than YOU DO!  If you make $20K a year, you don't want to pay taxes, but tax that rich bastard who makes $40K a year.  If you make $40K a year, you don't want to pay taxes, but tax that rich bastard who makes $60K a year.  Get the point?<P>I'm paying about 40% in taxes (everything combined), and I'm no where near rich.  Do you see me complaining about people who make more than I do?  No.  I don't like paying that much in taxes, and when I can make a change by voting, I do it.  I'm doing what I can to earn more - to eventually make more than the people I now view as "rich."<P>Remember, it's not government's job to provide for the people.  That would be socialism.  And we're getting very close to that.  ||||reg||1
Z||000014||frontal lobe||08-15-2001||02:08 PM||||rayb,<P>maybe more in % of income, but still WAY less total dollars.<P>Democrats are always saying we should "pay our fair share".  Well how much is that?  Ans.:  Well, we don't know but no matter how much you are paying, it should be more.<P>The answer isn't tax increases or cuts, its SPENDING cuts.  Quit spending on programs that have never worked and never will work.  Remember several years ago when they refused to pass a budget so the government "shut down" for a while?  How many of you even noticed or cared?  That should tell you something.<P>And rayb, I always enjoy your posts even if we don't always agree.  Serious.||||reg||1
