Z||000057||maryjane||08-17-2001||02:33 AM||||[QUOTE]Originally posted by fogglethorpe:<BR>[B]<BR>9)The Federal Government is the provider, protector, and empowerer of all people.<P>I consider myself a conservative (of sorts), only wealthy on paper,(keep buying gas & petroleum products!), and do believe far left or 'traditional thinking liberals' take spending and taxation to the extreme. That quote should read, "The federal government is the provider, protector, and empowerer of all people not provided for or protected by any other means. What I mean is, it is a shame that we can spend so many billions on ill-thought out programs while the really poor can't get adequate housing or meals. There ARE people here in this country who, through no fault of their own, can't take care of themselves or their families.  <P>10)Rich people are vermin, and acquired their wealth on the backs of the poor. For this, they should be severely punished by litigation and taxation.<BR>The first sentence in #10 is true to an extent. Not the vermin part but the fact that made their money on the backs of the poor. There is a class system in this country even today. If you don't think so, re-read the different opinions posted here. It's so thick you can stir it with a stick.<P>This is going to sound hypocritical after the first part I posted but I'm going to tell it anyway to lighten things up. Heard of a group that was discussing just these sort of topics and one guy said he believed all the wealth in America should be divided up evenly to all the people. When told that the same ones that have most of the wealth today would have it again within 1 yr of the disbursment, he said, "Oh no, I meant divide it up every Saturday night" Guess you would have had to be there.||||reg||1
Z||000058||DaRkLoRD||08-17-2001||04:31 PM||||whether I'm agreeing or disagreeing with someone about this topic.. I still get ticked off at my olf high school, and I end up venting, and it usually sounds like I'm b*tching at the people I talk to.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>p.s. taxes wouldn't need to be so high if the stupid government would spend their money more efficiently..<P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
